{"id": "EUVD-2026-108282", "enisaUuid": "0448c399-1809-3855-9248-e2bbe3e85be0", "description": "OpenBao before 2.6.4 and 2.7.x before 2.7.1 fails to write response audit entries for the unauthenticated sys/generate-root, sys/rekey, and sys/rekey-recovery-key endpoints when request audit logging succeeds but response audit logging fails. An attacker using these endpoints can complete root token generation or rekey operations without a corresponding response audit record, hindering forensic detection.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:33", "baseScore": 2.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:H/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openbao/openbao/security/advisories/GHSA-q74w-hv5x-6hxf", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openbao-before-2.6.4-and-2.7.0-before-2.7.1-improper-audit-logging-of-root-generation-and-rekey-responses"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115357", "GHSA-wcpv-xrx9-27pw"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0816a930-9164-3767-a02f-394f9deed368", "product": {"name": "openbao", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}, "product_version": "2.7.0 <2.7.1"}, {"id": "7d7c8a4c-11ee-3b4f-a80f-c4f34d1ece67", "product": {"name": "openbao", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.6.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "90f15afe-298b-3af9-91a3-2468d29a7e14", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}], "isExploited": false}